ool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53093, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_016EBgqHJvD1HqNCjEGkMhR7", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 54459, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01YDmztkCHpCTJ2gniKXuEZ3", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 54759, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01YDmztkCHpCTJ2gniKXuEZ3", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54759, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01YDmztkCHpCTJ2gniKXuEZ3", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 58824, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is back on v2.3.0 in all three regions and healthy again, and SEV2 incident INC-0001 is open.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- v2.3.1 was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west with about an 18% error rate. v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy. The v2.3.1 release candidate was also unhealthy.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an error in the deployment system. That left us-east on v2.3.0 and the other two regions still on v2.3.1.\n- I ran the rollback again, and it finished in all three regions. The error rate is now about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident INC-0001:**\n- The request to create it timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so there's no duplicate.\n- It covers the failure, the rollback (including the halted first attempt), the current state and follow-ups.\n\n**Follow-ups:**\n- Find out why v2.3.1 failed.\n- Find out why the first rollback stopped partway.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_012ayE4cZAVFmY2MWj13uBJa", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01LfmShYesvmVaLcadHC3qBo", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_019FMeFRCncgeWabyfXVW2S1", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01VmeR3yevaPHdHf4ALDhQEx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to a set version is safe to repeat, so I'll try it once more.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01GCVnCQS7GkjDGGqhgUe6Gn", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Vr6zDNbpdDhk9Nyo1CiiYT", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01C57iUfJe66b4pzKhtHbWKx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_016EBgqHJvD1HqNCjEGkMhR7", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest deploy) was failing health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an error rate of ~18%. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east due to an orchestrator error (partial failure: us-east on v2.3.0, us-west/eu-west still on v2.3.1); a retry completed the rollout in all regions. Post-rollback: all regions on v2.3.0, service healthy, error rate ~0.2%. Follow-ups: root-cause v2.3.1 (v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy) and investigate the orchestrator error during rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01YDmztkCHpCTJ2gniKXuEZ3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "checkout-api is back on v2.3.0 in all three regions and healthy again, and SEV2 incident INC-0001 is open.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- v2.3.1 was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west with about an 18% error rate. v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy. The v2.3.1 release candidate was also unhealthy.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an error in the deployment system. That left us-east on v2.3.0 and the other two regions still on v2.3.1.\n- I ran the rollback again, and it finished in all three regions. The error rate is now about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident INC-0001:**\n- The request to create it timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so there's no duplicate.\n- It covers the failure, the rollback (including the halted first attempt), the current state and follow-ups.\n\n**Follow-ups:**\n- Find out why v2.3.1 failed.\n- Find out why the first rollback stopped partway.", "type": "text"}]}]}